Copyright (C) 2021 Amelia Liao and contributors, AGPL-3.0-only.
Outcrop inherits the adapted Agda palette and type-hover design from Bedrock.
The vendored upstream tree is src/outcrop/site/resources/vendor/1lab/ and keeps
its source commit and license. Its bundled component notices are retained in
vendor/1lab/static/licenses (KaTeX and octicons MIT, Noto Emoji Apache-2.0,
fast-fuzzy ISC, and fonts SIL OFL-1.1).

KaTeX: https://katex.org, MIT. The page loads the pinned KaTeX CSS and JavaScript
from a CDN; mathematics rendering does not block other reader interactions.

Self-hosted fonts under src/outcrop/site/resources/static/fonts/, SIL OFL-1.1:
- EB Garamond: https://github.com/octaviopardo/EBGaramond12
- Inria Sans: https://github.com/BlackFoundryCom/InriaFonts
- JuliaMono: https://github.com/cormullion/juliamono
- Noto Sans Math 3.000: https://github.com/notofonts/math

Bedrock Dotted Operators is the existing JuliaMono-derived two-cluster subset.
Bedrock Universe Levels is the existing Noto subset, with Unicode script digits
derived from its MATH metrics. Their historical internal family names and
outlines are retained to avoid changing typography during extraction. They are
font identifiers, not a website-brand default. Each upstream license is beside
the fonts. Reproduction scripts are in scripts/build-*-font.py.
